{"4235630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NYRA: The Fall of Light", "steam_appid": 4235630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4287910], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NYRA: The Fall of Light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A dark fantasy Action RPG focused on skill-based combat and exploration.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NYRA: The Fall of Light</strong> is a story-driven, single-player, third-person <strong>Action RPG</strong> set in a dark fantasy world.<br>The game focuses on <strong>real-time combat</strong>, demanding <strong>reflexes, precise timing, and ability management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Nyra Valen</strong>, a warrior summoned from another world, exploring ancient ruins, cursed lands, dungeons, and fallen cities—shaping both the fate of the world and your own destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every encounter rewards timing, positioning, and smart ability usage.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time third-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, defense, area-based magic, and time-slow abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee and magic-based attack combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex- and positioning-focused encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/00f361c5e57343a01b82d7f272ad96af.poster.avif?t=1769036101\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/00f361c5e57343a01b82d7f272ad96af.webm?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/00f361c5e57343a01b82d7f272ad96af.mp4?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traversal &amp; Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement plays a key role in exploration and combat flow.<br>Abilities are not only tools for fighting, but also for reaching new areas and gaining vertical advantage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and responsive character movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability-based traversal mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical exploration and environmental navigation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/38ecf2e42b31357e68bca74f96b85a1f.poster.avif?t=1769036101\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/38ecf2e42b31357e68bca74f96b85a1f.webm?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/38ecf2e42b31357e68bca74f96b85a1f.mp4?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World &amp; Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of NYRA is built to be explored at your own pace, blending dark fantasy themes with environmental storytelling.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient cities, castles, and underground ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic atmosphere and weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic presentation without losing gameplay control</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/7269c751bd7e5420651f75f87b1a5f3d.poster.avif?t=1769036101\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/7269c751bd7e5420651f75f87b1a5f3d.webm?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/7269c751bd7e5420651f75f87b1a5f3d.mp4?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss &amp; Enemy Encounters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies with distinct attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena-based boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics that reward learning patterns and precise timing</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active and passive abilities unlocked over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-driven combat style customization</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player (Offline playable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; mouse support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More content and systems will be expanded during development.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NYRA: The Fall of Light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A dark fantasy Action RPG focused on skill-based combat and exploration.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NYRA: The Fall of Light</strong> is a story-driven, single-player, third-person <strong>Action RPG</strong> set in a dark fantasy world.<br>The game focuses on <strong>real-time combat</strong>, demanding <strong>reflexes, precise timing, and ability management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Nyra Valen</strong>, a warrior summoned from another world, exploring ancient ruins, cursed lands, dungeons, and fallen cities—shaping both the fate of the world and your own destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every encounter rewards timing, positioning, and smart ability usage.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time third-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, defense, area-based magic, and time-slow abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee and magic-based attack combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex- and positioning-focused encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/00f361c5e57343a01b82d7f272ad96af.poster.avif?t=1769036101\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/00f361c5e57343a01b82d7f272ad96af.webm?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235630/extras/00f361c5e57343a01b82d7f272ad96af.mp4?t=1769036101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></